1db27b9878492336832e386e779c1f23b"}, "language": "english", "review": "good, fun with friends", "timestamp_created": 1762550264, "timestamp_updated": 1762550264, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1740578356", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "208662440", "author": {"steamid": "76561198080572863", "personaname": "Rowanrho", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/lvilaguillen/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 7245, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4595, "last_played": 1786258600, "avatar": "933440af5a2f142ecf871330d176d45a0e7404bb"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is super fun game that stands as hybrid between the suspense in Lethal Company and the action and fun of Sketchy Contract. I love the robot design so much (also the little details such as if you talk, the rest of the robot avatar look at you). Also the design of the monsters feels novel and fun, also creepy sometimes. Also the mechanics on how to pick up items, and can be broken, and the weight and reach as variables add a lot to the already fun mechanics (and more caos!).\r\nI would add more movement to the head once you die (you can't do so much aside from talking a bit), also i would add some kind of revive -aside from the one in checkpoints- (so people who are dead don't keep on hanging on doing nothing). Just as neat peak I would add an RGB wheell to change between more colors, and, maybe, skins or items to change the look a bit.\r\nAside from that, super recommended if you like games such as Lethal Company and Sketchy Contract.", "timestamp_created": 1762550042, "timestamp_updated": 1762550042, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score":